  m_Name: TutDiet
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  label: Diet
  gifAnim: {fileID: 7400000, guid: fe61ea09773dcf947b71f9465b1515eb, type: 2}
  description: '- Eating food from certain diets changes your diet type (Carnivore,
    Herbivore, Omnivore)

    - Eating food from diets other than your own cuts the
    food efficiency by half (except for Omnivore)

    - Every diet type has its
    own Talent Tree, changing diets resets the tree

    - Check your Character Screen
    (C) for more details'
